From 971a57afa31c6ea002f4e01bcdcd600b6a0ca749 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sunghyun kim <scholb.kim@samsung.com>
Date: Tue, 15 Sep 2026 17:18:52 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] Defer Lottie loading until its load policy allows it

Replace LottieAnimationView dirty-triggered creation with lifecycle-gated
creation. Retain playback requests and dynamic callbacks before creation,
and expose LoadPolicy with ATTACHED as the default. Hidden views and hidden
ancestors defer creation until shown; IMMEDIATE permits off-scene loading.

Enforce the policy in the animated vector visual and retain animation data
until metadata has loaded. Preserve explicit desired sizes, invalidate
measurement on creation, and suppress premature resource-ready signals.

Add loader-count regression coverage and document lifecycle behavior and
follow-up work for ImageView and AnimatedImageView update scheduling.

Validation: foundation library build and 208 related test cases passed
during implementation; declaration and call sites checked after renaming
the loading predicate to IsReadyToLoad. git diff --check passed.
